---
// @ts-ignore
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const features = [
{
    title: "Smart Rebalancing: The Key to Maximizing Your Returns",
    description:
      "Securely connect your brokerage account and manage investments in one place(More brokers cooming soon).",
    icon: "bx:bxs-badge-check",
  },
  {
    title: "Portfolio Tracking",
    description:
      "View all your holdings, allocations, and stock performance at a glance.",
    icon: "bx:bxs-bar-chart-alt-2",
  },
  {
    title: "One-Click Rebalancing",
    description:
      "Preview and execute rebalancing operations with ease.",
    icon: "bx:recycle",
  },
  {
    title: "Smart Simulation",
    description:
      " Test different rebalancing strategies before committing.",
    icon: "bx:brain",
  },
  {
    title: " Support for Non-Margin Accounts",
    description:
      " Even if your account doesn’t allow margin, you can still simulate rebalancing scenarios.",
    icon: "bx:support",
  },

];
---

<div class="mt-16 md:mt-0">
  <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold lg:tracking-tight">
    Why Rebalancing Matters ?
  </h2>
  <p class="text-lg mt-4 text-slate-600">
    Investing is not just about buying and holding; maintaining the right
    balance in your portfolio is key to long-term success. Market fluctuations
    can cause your portfolio to drift from your target allocation, increasing
    risk and reducing potential gains. Rebalancing helps you stay on track,
    ensuring your investments align with your financial goals.
  </p>
  <p class="text-lg mt-4 text-slate-600">
    Without rebalancing, you may unknowingly carry more risk than intended.
    Rebalance App automates this process, making it easier than ever to monitor,
    simulate, and execute rebalancing strategies—so you can focus on growing
    your wealth.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 mt-16 gap-16">
  {
    features.map((item) => (
      <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
        <div class="mt-1 bg-black rounded-full  p-2 w-8 h-8 shrink-0">
          <Icon class="text-white" name={item.icon} />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">{item.title}</h3>{" "}
          <p class="text-slate-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">{item.description}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))
  }
</div>
